**`Belgian Client Enterprise Number` also cited `Source: CCG Module 2.2`** — exactly the pattern that saved `A1 Certificate Held Indicator` last pass. Your read of the *descriptions* was right; the **Additional Notes** column told a different story for this one row, so I checked it instead of sweeping it along.

